sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Gateway API (Envoy)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant VLLM_HTTP as vLLM HTTP Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant TGIS as TGIS gRPC Adapter<br/>8033/TCP gRPC
    participant Engine as vLLM Engine<br/>(in-process)
    participant GPU as NVIDIA GPU<br/>CUDA Runtime
    participant S3 as Model Storage<br/>S3 / PVC / HF Hub

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 1: Model Loading at Startup
    S3-->>Engine: Model weights<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>AWS IAM / HMAC / Bearer
    Engine->>GPU: Load model to GPU memory<br/>CUDA runtime

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 2: OpenAI-Compatible HTTP Inference
    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Bearer Token (OAuth/OIDC)
    Gateway->>KRBAC: Forward request<br/>HTTPS/8443 TLS<br/>SubjectAccessReview
    KRBAC->>VLLM_HTTP: Proxy (pre-authorized)<br/>HTTP/8000 plaintext<br/>pod-internal
    VLLM_HTTP->>Engine: Inference request<br/>(in-process)
    Engine->>GPU: CUDA compute<br/>CUDA runtime
    GPU-->>Engine: Tensor results
    Engine-->>VLLM_HTTP: Completion response
    VLLM_HTTP-->>KRBAC: JSON response
    KRBAC-->>Gateway: HTTPS response
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON response<br/>HTTPS/443

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 3: TGIS gRPC Inference
    Client->>Gateway: gRPC GenerationService<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Bearer Token (OAuth/OIDC)
    Gateway->>KRBAC: Forward request<br/>gRPC-HTTP2/8443 TLS<br/>SubjectAccessReview
    KRBAC->>TGIS: Proxy (pre-authorized)<br/>gRPC/8033 plaintext<br/>pod-internal
    TGIS->>Engine: In-process Python call
    Engine->>GPU: CUDA compute<br/>CUDA runtime
    GPU-->>Engine: Tensor results
    Engine-->>TGIS: Inference result
    TGIS-->>KRBAC: gRPC response
    KRBAC-->>Gateway: gRPC response
    Gateway-->>Client: gRPC response<br/>HTTPS/443
